  "description": "Get ready for your next off-road ride with the Reid MTB Sport - a capable mountain bike designed to get you out on the trails with confidence.\nBuilt around a lightweight 6061 aluminium frame, the MTB Sport offers a durable and reliable platform for everyday riding. The front suspension fork helps smooth out bumps along the way, and the mechanical lock-out lets you firm things up when riding on smoother paths or roads.\nThe 7-speed Shimano gearing makes it easy to find the right gear for climbs and flat sections, while dependable V brakes provide consistent stopping power when you need it. Alloy double-wall rims paired with 27.5×2.10″ tyres deliver a stable and comfortable ride across a variety of terrain.\nA steel riser bar keeps your riding position comfortable and controlled, whether you're navigating local trails, park paths, or gravel tracks. The MTB Sport is built to be ride ready, making it a great choice for riders looking to start exploring off-road.\nWhether you're heading out for weekend trail rides or everyday adventures, the Reid MTB Sport is a practical and reliable way to enjoy mountain biking.",
